orting performance reports, analysis, and proposal data upon request</li><li>Prepares, processes, and controls records, narratives, reports, and other documents</li><li>Schedules, arranges and coordinates design and logistics for events and meetings; and completes other work assigned</li><li>May perform functions such as accounting or budgeting</li></ul><div><br></div> NJSBDA - Headquarters Newark Chancellor-L2 Rutgers Business School-L3 6938 https://jobs.rutgers.edu/postings/266377 2026-01-01T00:03:23-05:00 2026-01-01T00:03:27-05:00 Instructor - Part-time for Non-credit Classes - Turf <div>The Rutgers Professional Golf Turf Management Program invites applications for instructors to teach non-credit courses (multi-hour sessions) to adult learners on our New Brunswick campus via in-person and/or online formats. We are seeking industry professionals and subject matter experts who want to join our team of renowned instructors and share their knowledge with our participants in our world-class learning center. We have trained thousands of successful greenskeepers and groundskeepers from across the country and around the world with our practical, real-world concepts of turfgrass and team management. Instructors will develop and present course material during the assigned course times, coordinate materials with the Program Coordinator, and follow-up with necessary paperwork. We welcome new course ideas to broaden the knowledge of our turf professionals and keep them up to date with current and future industry trends. The Office of Continuing Professional Education invites applicants to visit our website for more information about our program: cpe.rutgers.edu/golf-turf . **Evergreen Posting to 12/31/2026**</div> Continuing Professional Educat New Brunswick Chancellor-L2 School Environ & Biologicl Sci-L3 6966 25FA1181 https://jobs.rutgers.edu/postings/280180 2026-08-31T10:37:59-04:00 2026-08-31T10:38:00-04:00 Regional Scheduler UCHC NJSP <div>Rutgers University Correctional 